    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5624fa210bcebc86cadc64aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天似乎能得到这些。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4458cb57ef1a77eb32b94a2225a34c7951790a232b823b461e0c38027bd7783",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39ff4feb0d554a21164636d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔呣，就算是我\r\n继续研究的体力也…哈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c26b8bd705879a7f734482072c4766a7a95ef6d2855b02cb0099d587b126167f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13494ded68a99eb7c0487af8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这种状态就算跑步也…\r\n嗯…该休息了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f65ad5c170b6762d9409e8b49ee0a936f059b2c0600e8ca259ce48aa045f0828",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9dbe9971044d556790cdf2f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的我比任何时候都\r\n充满了可能性…！\r\n来验证一下吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2b8168b742d6ae3af55607803c60b031341b2ee6d0ac3a9e78b2226a521e537",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb7d56342f52b207c07a8c4e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "桀桀桀…状态真是绝佳！\r\n昨天的实验果然成功了。\r\n现在一定能拿出优异的成果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1302fe0b0d7ab18e49b1108e9af8b3a3d76e3d0f17ce6d731663e5ed1a977e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49f5124db50ae5989b5d24b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "或许是探讨光速不变原理的梦\r\n令我的大脑活跃起来了。\r\n我今天的状态绝佳呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1df8562cbac2784fbb317a91903363b94366dcf79769ddcd1b94f8ec0a6620f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23ad5e1fa135080d2a69abf5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯…感觉身体很轻盈呢。\r\n这样应该能比平时更\r\n全神贯注地进行研究。",
      "source_fingerprint": "418bc454ce2e334f45a1504ab770ec2ba27aab4f4c05170121d6f4c56b9678e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89b7217380102dda0292df95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赶快开始吧。\r\n毕竟要保持住这种干劲\r\n也相当不容易啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1d4b25018a68b40f38fc4420f4b3ac314a6e53a78fadcc12ef738798b68f5e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d39065acb6b42d93d1f81ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "气温、心跳和其他各项数值\r\n均与平时无异。也就是说\r\n我的状态跟往常一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "94b3ab2bf736219c10c547bdd3a95c3316c6b47ec9e4994ac27b446782d718f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea27848bacc67abcfa8a2bd8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯…总感觉有点犯懒…\r\n也会有这种日子呢…",
      "source_fingerprint": "8887b13eacb604e542f75680d63e32d453384d0c532ad2288da5abf475256a62",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66087245071c42359df3483f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然想尝试一下\n新的实验…哈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "55c4ff75501f8476c6e35eb503976a161bf48037c54c866e51acfa819565deba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef2ad63d315b70ccba38127c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊…总感觉状态很不好…\r\n话虽如此，要是不完成今天的计划\r\n也会影响到下次实验…",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d12e708bfb04a4c5f6d301560817a4047fda57d3f7a830b111ebcb9e05c47c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23a2194d07e2d605246f87f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…我的干劲现在好像失踪了呢…\r\n不过你放心，该做的我还是会去做的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0caa7df7daa196e41ec35ea0fbedc671f9d7be8da85903e6eaa1c698b27f0390",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13d1a533f51cbec6848355da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦呀，又要比赛？\r\n…真是的，把我累成这样\r\n难道你有什么企图不成？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a10aadac852520ef8a08c38a073ae468ac66ecc346c934dd596c90eca14a73bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab867a4bca2b3b94aad66de6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然在赛场收集数据也很重要，\r\n但这次应该在书桌上专心研究啊，\r\n不然除了积攒疲劳之外，得不到任何东西哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "90986ea0debc20b5eea7fc104fb0a49d117fc17426996e951c656778b7ed078b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c560c6ddbe8420ed0e8d367",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这完美的状态，\r\n正可谓研究的成果啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7580623489e0a8cf395cf4d43bc5be23e05051ef6c577e28a091d2d81a99526",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d34a9e30c1307501eb903a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊，好想赶快验证理论。\r\n真是的…一着急就容易\r\n产生毫无意义的亢奋！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f57641035a2fade9b8f3edbabc6a977c9e411fcdb85e47d2b8ee1d3606f351c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06fac09bf6b370adda74fdfa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "全身都在发热。…桀桀，仿佛全身的细胞\r\n都在命令我奔跑一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b1b2511b020a09b7d21632e3a8b53dacfe3753f9d4a0762b8983f8720ecb435",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db38187f9149ad142147fb6e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，迄今为止的实验似乎\r\n都成功了。准备得也很充分，\r\n就等结果了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "723e802c59e7eaf4c732610924adeb46a5c169fd206b31cfed4452987f5a416e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cda34ec50cc433d91444159b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "心情很好，状态不错。\r\n这样能得出怎样的结果呢\r\n开始实验吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ad2fb5aa15c8214916d9fd567e0ce7a03bbfc482a95d52e4012021822f64826",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63285b6cec379e8c711b983d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "桀桀桀…状态很棒。\r\n面对马娘们那绝佳的肉体\r\n我的干劲也提高了啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "efa3d12fd25588b17660d630030caa355e36eae4766c6bfe15ee5b30e325000d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:732193aa761809ec3330fc94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还没能达到增加细胞\r\n那种程度的实验…\r\n但从状态来看也不算差。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d5111943e6aeb28ace3662283db99ec1511c224d2d2a0050badceb938b109a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9790271b4f5179d723f0cd36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不好不坏，\r\n状态不错…\r\n能拿出怎样的结果呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "59b71438ebc6a625ff301155f9fc3abc82e2773cbeff6de15a3d60ffdae1b50d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7be353f92d7059bc4f20805e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态跟往常一样。\r\n平日的结果如何，\r\n你可得给我好好记录一下哦",
      "source_fingerprint": "e95d6d7817d7fd01752644f6c8925a17ec1d6f613e0bcb5ac4e70d0971c3a463",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:698b90b3719ae10a0faf1a9a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯…是我太专注于研究\r\n而没做好调整吗。\r\n算了，船到桥头自然直！",
      "source_fingerprint": "76bb9654edbc8e065ca5dd13266186b953064833e242c1e43638d0c69ee786ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c80c6b779097c96bde827b05",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "据说失败是成功之母。\r\n即便状态不佳，\r\n也能有所收获。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98e4f19f3a93fc97e6ec485b593c2e67fa62231c43ee08ece7e1d36d071255a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff2dc20e3d1221e27c68c45e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态不是很好，\r\n或许今天应该着重观察才对…",
      "source_fingerprint": "d772c264c669f1875bb6901fb1acfa2b2974cae46b53604912590c69954b18bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11f67981ac40f0642b90d4c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "凡事不总是一帆风顺的啊…\r\n现在状态不算好，\r\n算了，尽我所能吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b83a92fa4ddaeb72640f70c6d9a1f5d1d25b767ce2fdb2ca6ffc10d045c94e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d1ad98ec7a5109d25522370",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "倦怠…原因不明的倦怠感。\r\n但也有在这个状态下\r\n才能得到的数据…呼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc30e509a8bb359303330753483444d27e28e17a4943615e34f7a94c28705c1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e2703ef6218de857b0b0629",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态极差啊！\r\n差到我现在就想回家睡大觉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ef727da0990f405086ec1f4773434df47b11911ce16f58886c6d6b19831cbb1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc8d7effb1ffe0b5f3f183f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5340d32cafefeb07fb71f273be0d9e41c17a0c3f97ce3ec0784aa70ad39fd299",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9766cb66bf7fcd45da0690c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e2d53b9afc302fe6193a0f0c17c886a3d13d1fd0a390efb052c4a77ba94a09d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68da01bc31b27281444552dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉很有意思呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbdbeec2a7a053971213d485801dfadc521041a93c24268480bd066df083702f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c5c52658dc1f2f2fa8900fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "交给我吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0f70558d850ecc83c59a7f556d74001d25e024c7fa3678ca8a6cbcf1ef56f92",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b42b0d94293c8e201e0636a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "05e7370a30507c08e7c88f5cd20beba946c167e6356f5907582aada8cb498bdf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c429987c3234cecf883da5b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦呀？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c86f5ae001b4c8005e0478632e7cccc4e77b559324fa7c08f2250ac40b12c990",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96ac63e624884ccd63d119d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0f0665e0a69c08888c3252e4588492414e62eb2a101e0b2a5a81f3189d824bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e455d5052803929f048421ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "02cd6b35d4f141be59253fb500ef97b74206f2f2cd2d3fb1a7ba9ed4047d0164",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3285f9babe7b825e06e6474d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "研究可没有尽头哦，豚鼠君！",
      "source_fingerprint": "535a4e49c8914b81615f3bc3123f7bea74da5486bc441ea069d3dbc5d6c2bf1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fd78af50452723276ae4bdf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员君，来吧！一切都要重新验证！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3ee977c3f916d97475e041c9842faad94d687efb22062f8694436c2f3a41ac1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8d3716f58c7b09f8eaf53ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我观察一下哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "64e9b0f06deda02e97596b0761895ff29fa568ff6def9ff3e019ddd07e4819d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cac6ff86229079284c7cc87d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来，开始实验吧…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "98b360a0e3a6f6c0e5aabdddf66c7466879a88af205fa01d69681d5f5cfc296a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b455815d62ddba01e2b6004",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来，扩大可能性吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "168ab651ac3fda8c489a15fc46419d8a91230a7caf542572ec7294c526a97037",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:398a6856fc8070984d7590e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "研究可没有尽头哦，豚鼠君！",
      "source_fingerprint": "535a4e49c8914b81615f3bc3123f7bea74da5486bc441ea069d3dbc5d6c2bf1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8048218fafa60dcc33d3dfc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "桀桀桀…状态很棒。\r\n面对马娘们那绝佳的肉体，\r\n我的干劲也提高了啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3a1722c66b1cb60569e1397d7e0577a466640dc1565141adb3eff763ebb31b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
